OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FAs part of a series of reports
OL,7,Finvestigating the use of e-bikes in
OL,8,Fthe North West, ITV Granada Reports'
OL,9,FAnna Youssef has spoken to "Jeanie"
OL,10,Fwho was involved in a hit-and-run
OL,11,Fincident.
OL,13,FA woman who fractured her ribs when
OL,14,Fshe was struck by a masked e-bike
OL,15,Frider who then fled the scene is
OL,16,Fcalling for "stringent rules" and "the
OL,17,Fwhole system looked at".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,F'Jeanie', whose real name ITV News is
OL,7,Fwithholding to protect her identity,
OL,8,Fwas hit with such force that she was
OL,9,Fthrown onto a metal bin before falling
OL,10,Fto the floor.
OL,12,FThe male rider, who was wearing a face
OL,13,Fcovering at the time of the incident,
OL,14,Ffled the scene of the hit-and-run in
OL,15,FFebruary at the Pyramids Shopping
OL,16,FCentre, Birkenhead, on the Wirral.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FShe said: "I had some fractured ribs
OL,7,Fand I had a lot of internal bruising.
OL,8,FI wasn't able to walk for at least
OL,9,Fthree weeks and obviously it affected
OL,10,Fme emotionally."
OL,12,FJeanie, who is in her 60s and suffers
OL,13,Ffrom osteoporosis, was left stranded
OL,14,Fon the ground in severe pain, deeply
OL,15,Fconfused and worried she had broken
OL,16,Fbones.
OL,18,FShe added: "I heard this very fast
OL,19,Fwearing noise and I know I had
OL,20,Fabsolutely no chance of getting out
OL,21,Fthe way.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,F"The bike crashed into me which then
OL,7,Fthrew me. I just landed on the metal
OL,8,Fbin. He stopped very briefly and said
OL,9,F'are you alright'.
OL,11,F"I was in too much of a shock to
OL,12,Fanswer him at that point and he then
OL,13,Frode off. You don't stand a chance, if
OL,14,Fyou're in the way, you're in the way
OL,15,Fand that's that."
OL,17,FMerseyside Police is still searching
OL,18,Ffor the man, who fled the scene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,F"I was deeply shocked by the lack of
OL,7,Fconcern. He just wanted to continue
OL,8,Fwith his journey," Jeanie said.
OL,10,F"He had no idea at all of what
OL,11,Finjuries I'd had."
OL,13,FUnfortunately, this was not an
OL,14,Fisolated incident for Jeanie. Just a
OL,15,Fcouple of weeks later, she experienced
OL,16,Fanother terrifying near-miss involving
OL,17,Ftwo men riding together on a single e-
OL,18,Fbike, weaving through a crowd of
OL,19,Fpedestrians.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FThe survivor is now demanding
OL,7,Fimmediate action from authorities to
OL,8,Fprotect the public from other e-bike
OL,9,Frelated incidents in the community.
OL,11,FShe said: "I believe there should
OL,12,Fwithout a doubt be stringent rules and
OL,13,Fthe whole system looked at."
OL,15,FWhat are the rules for E-bikes in the
OL,16,FUK?
OL,18,FIn the UK, a legal e-bike is treated
OL,19,Fthe same as a standard bicycle,
OL,20,Fprovided it meets specific criteria.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FThe e-bike is a hybrid form of
OL,7,Ftransport where part of the power
OL,8,Fcomes from the rider and the other
OL,9,Fpart from the motor.
OL,11,FIt must feature pedal assistance, the
OL,12,Fmotor's continuous rated power output
OL,13,Fmust not exceed 250 Watts, and the
OL,14,Fassistance must cut off automatically
OL,15,Fonce the bike reaches 15.5mph.
OL,17,FThe rider must also be at least 14 on
OL,18,Fpublic roads.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FAny vehicle designed or altered for
OL,7,Fhigher speeds, or operate without
OL,8,Fpedaling, is reclassified as a moped
OL,9,For motorcycle.
OL,11,FMopeds or motorcycles require valid
OL,12,Flicensing, insurance, and full road-
OL,13,Flegal compliance. Failure to meet
OL,14,Fthese standards can lead to fines,
OL,15,Fpoints on a driving license, or
OL,16,Fvehicle seizure.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
