FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785341919
OL,3,CWoman who fractured ribs when hit by e-
OL,4,Cbike calls for 'stringent rules'
OL,6,FMerseyside Police has seized more than
OL,7,F1,600 illegal e-bikes in the past year
OL,8,Fas part of Operation Gears, a campaign
OL,9,Fto tackle the use of illegal e-bikes
OL,10,Fand disrupt criminal gangs.
OL,12,FSuperintendent Phil Mullally, said:
OL,13,F"We've seized record numbers this year
OL,14,Falone and there are officers out daily
OL,15,Ftackling the issue of e-bikes, seizing
OL,16,Fthem and stopping some really
OL,17,Fsignificant individuals who are
OL,18,Finvolved in criminality and putting
OL,19,Fthose offenders before the court."
OL,26,@uD@AOU{D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
